{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-8-1","title":"Revelation 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 At the opening of the seventh seal, 2 Seven angels have seven trumpets given them. 6 Four of them sound their trumpets and great plagues follow. 9 Another angel puts incense to the prayers of the saints on the golden altar.</p>\n<p>And. 5:1,9; 6:1,3,5,7,9,12 silence. Job 4:16; Ps 37:7; 62:1; *marg: Hab 2:20; Zec 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-2","title":"Revelation 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>seven angels. 15:1; 16:1; Mt 18:10; Lu 1:19 trumpets. 6-12; 9:1,13,14; 11:15; Nu 10:1-10; 2Ch 29:25-28; Am 3:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-3","title":"Revelation 8:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>another. 7:2; 10:1; Ge 48:15,16; Ex 3:2-18; Ac 7:30-32 stood. 9:13; Ex 30:1-8; 2Ch 26:16-20; Ro 8:34; Heb 7:25 having. Le 16:12; 1Ki 7:50; Heb 9:4 much. Le 16:13; Nu 16:46,47; Mal 1:11 offer it with the prayers. or, add it to the prayers. 4; 5:8; Ps 141:2; Lu 1:10; Heb 4:15,16; 10:19-22; 1Jo 2:1,2 the golden. 6:9; 9:13; Ex 37:25,26; 40:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-4","title":"Revelation 8:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>3; 15:8; Ex 30:1; Ps 141:2; Lu 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-5","title":"Revelation 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>and filled. 16:1-21; Isa 66:6,14-16; Jer 51:11; Eze 10:2-7; Lu 12:49 into. or, upon. and there. 4:5; 11:19; 16:18; 2Sa 22:7-9; Ps 18:13; Isa 30:30; Heb 12:18,19 an. 11:13,19; 1Ki 19:11; Isa 29:6; Zec 14:5; Mt 24:7; 27:52-54; Ac 4:31 Ac 16:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-7","title":"Revelation 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>hail. 16:21; Ex 9:23-25,33; Jos 10:11; Ps 11:5,6; 18:12,13; 78:47,48 Ps 105:32; Isa 28:2; 29:6; 30:30; 32:19; Eze 13:10-15; 38:22 Mt 7:25-27 cast. 16:2 the third. 9,10,12; 6:8; 9:4; Isa 2:12,13; 10:17,18; Jas 1:11; 1Pe 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-8","title":"Revelation 8:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>and as. Jer 51:25; Mr 11:23 burning. Am 7:4 the third. 7; 16:3-21; Ex 7:17-21; Eze 14:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-9","title":"Revelation 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the third part of the creatures. 7,10,12; 16:3; Ex 7:21; Zec 13:8 the ships. Ps 48:7; Isa 2:16; 23:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-10","title":"Revelation 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>a great. 1:20; 6:13; 9:1; 12:4; Isa 14:12; Lu 10:18; Jude 1:13 the fountains. 16:4; Ex 7:20,21; Jud 15:11; 2Ki 2:19-22; 2Ch 32:3; Isa 12:3 Ho 13:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-11","title":"Revelation 8:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Wormwood. De 29:18; Ru 1:20; Pr 5:4; Jer 9:15; 23:15; La 3:5,19; Am 5:7; 6:12 Heb 12:15 many. Ex 15:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-12","title":"Revelation 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>and the third part of the sun. 16:8,9; Isa 13:10; 24:23; Jer 4:23; Eze 32:7,8; Joe 2:10,31; Am 8:9 Mt 24:29; 27:45; Mr 13:24; 15:33; Lu 21:25; 23:44,45; Ac 2:20 and the day. Ex 10:21-23; 2Co 4:4; 2Th 2:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-8-13","title":"Revelation 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>flying. 14:3,6; 19:17; Ps 103:20; Heb 1:14 Woe. 9:1,12; 11:14; Eze 2:10</p>"}]}